        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ageca kwoŋ citho kodi jathum banja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu oluwo ri jofonjirok pere iy'ageca kwoŋ riwin i kwayo ma cuny jo k'oŋedhere ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cango obedo jathum banja acel i tindi moro, ma k'olworo Were kendo k'oworo dhano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I tindi no won, oyido nitie citho moro m'omena bino bonge ka waco ni, ‘Amito ithekan gi jakwor paran!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hongo malac okadho ma jalo fodi onwaŋo kwero akwera, to rumacen won owaco gi i cunye ni, ‘Kada nende akilwor Were kendo akiwor dhano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to ro mijokere pa citho me, aripo miyo go gima ripo rigo, kak'ameno go bino kimena jokan tundo tho.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Rwoth owaco ni, “Wineno gima jathum banja m'ongoye g'adieri no ojok owaco? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Were ama k'oneni gir'atima ri ji pere m'oyer, ma jogoyo rigo koko wor g'odieceŋ? Wiparo ni go bino galo tektek gi konyo jo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aridho riwin ni go bino neno gimaber wotim rijo, kendo bino timo ameno i yoto. To ceŋ ma Wod Dhano odwok'iye, onwaŋ yeyo moro i piny?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ageca kwoŋ Jafarisayo kodi jacoki misolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu oluwo iy'ageca ri ji ma joŋoyo ni jobeyo i cuny gin aka jocayo wadi gin ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ji moro jokidho jario i Ot pa Were kwayo; ŋat'acel Jafarisayo, aka ŋatiman jacoki misolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jafarisayo ocungo to kwayo ni, ‘Were afoyin nike akical jomegi ma jomay ji gigipiny, jodiy wadi gin, jocot paka ji man, aka maloyo meno akical jacoki misolo me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariyo kec dirio i sabiti acel; aculo acel wiy apar kwoŋ gima alimo je.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jacoki misolo ocungo gi bor ma k'otemo kada tiŋo wiye malo yupolo; to ogoyo kore ayino ka waco ni, ‘Were, maki kodan wor, a jagimarac.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 23:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awaco riwin, jal me odok peco munyo otire ruwaŋ Were loyo Jafarisayo no. Ato ŋata won miyere dwoŋ ibino bwono, to ŋata bwonere am'ibino miyo dwoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu miyo nyithindho silwany",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji moro oyido jokelo nyithindho pajo bende ni Yesu wokethi cinge kwoŋ jo; to munyo jofonjirok joneno ameno, jobwoko jono ni jonyeko timo ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yesu olwoŋo nyithindho no bonge, to waco ni, “Weyi win nyithindho jowobin bongan! Wikiri wigeŋi jo, rupiri Ker pa Were obedo apa joma pameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri awaco riwin, ŋata kijol Ker pa Were paka nyathi kiladonj'iye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jaŋaŋo moro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acel kwoŋ jodhum pa Joyuda openjo ni, “Jafonji maber, mitere atim aŋo ŋey alimi kwo makirum?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu openjo go ni, “Raŋo m'ilwoŋan ni maber? Ongoye ŋataber kwanyo woko Were won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 20:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 5:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 20:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 5:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 20:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 5:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 20:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 5:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 20:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 5:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋeyo Or pa Were me: ‘Ikir'itim cot; Ikir'ikwal; ikir'ineki, lwor benin gi yokin.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋato owaco ni, “Wok i thino paran amako Or no je.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu owinjo gim'owaco me, owaco rigo ni, “To fodi mitere rin timo gimoro acel. Tana woko lim perin je, ipoki jocandi pesa mere, aka ibino limo ŋaŋo i polo, ŋey nyaka ibin iluwan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To munyo ŋato owinjo wac no ogut swa, rupiri go oyido oasa ŋaŋo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu oneno nike go ogut, owaco ni, “Tek swa ri jaŋaŋo donjo i Ker pa Were! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek swa ri jaŋaŋo donjo i Ker pa Were loyo kayina donjo i yore piso.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji ma jowinjo wac me jopenjo ni, “To ŋa won manyalo both?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu odwoko ni, “Gima kinyalere ri ji, nyalere ri Were.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Petero owaco ni, “Neni, kole watieko weyo pecin mawan waluwin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco rijo ni, “Ey, t'awaco riwin ama: Ongoye ŋat'owey peco pere kosa cege kosa wutmin kosa jonywol kosa nyithindho pere ro Ker pa Were ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma kilalimo gima dit loyo, i ndir ma pama kodi kwo makirum i ndir ma bino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu luwo ma didek kwoŋ tho pere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu otero jofonjirok pere gicen to waco rijo ni, “Neni win, onyo wakidho Yerusalem kama gimoro je ma jotuci wac Were jondiko kwoŋ Wod Dhano bino timer'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibino bolo go i cingi Jopath, ma jobino nyero go, yeto go, gi ŋulo kwoŋe law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino cwado go to joneko go, to i ndelo mar'adek ibino cerino go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jofonjirok jok'oniaŋ dwoŋ wac me; dwoŋ wac me opan rijo, aka jok'oŋeyo gima Yesu oyido luwo kwoŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu botho jakwac ma waŋ'otho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Yesu oriko Yeriko, ŋatimoro ma waŋ'otho onwaŋo obedo piny i thengi royo kwayere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ŋato owinjo lwak ji kadho, openjo ni, “Aŋo ma timere?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowaco rigo ni, “Yesu Janazareth ama kadho i royo ka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo ŋato okoko malo ni, “Yesu, Wod pa Daudi, maki kodan wor!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji m'oyido jotelo jobwoko go to jowaco rigo ni woliŋi. To go omedo koko malo ayin ni, “Wod pa Daudi, maki kodan wor!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu ocungo to oro jo kelo ŋata waŋ'otho no bonge. Munyo otundo cegin, Yesu openjo go ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imito atim rin aŋo?” Go odwoko ni, “Jadwoŋ, amito neno kendo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu owaco rigo ni, “Caki neno, yeyo perin obothin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo won to ŋato cako neno, to luwo Yesu, munyo foyo Were. Munyo ji je joneno gime, jopako Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
